    "solution": "Leave the lantern in the bottom workshop. Cut the seed left, cross behind it and cut it back so the burst enters the wall portal; the floor outlet lifts you onto the central ledge. Climb the hanging arm and turn it into a bridge to the western tally alcove. Cross back, wait until the moving carrier comes down beside the bridge, and board its deck. Ride to the high eastern dock, collect its tally and place an echo there. Return onto the same descending carrier, jump back to the bridge you made, cross west and fall down the broad return chute. Recover the original lantern and swap it up to the saved high dock. Carry its shade up the switchback stairs and across the final sunlit gap.",
    "entrance": "Low western seed workshop, with the lantern beside the return chute.",
    "exit": "High eastern sun balcony, about thirty-five tiles above the workshop.",
    "nearestExisting": "B36 seed placement through a portal; B11 a turned wall becomes the needed return bridge; B19 empty-handed travel establishes an echo cargo route; F37/Base supplies a moving mounted ring.",
    "novelty": "The initial launch, bridge and vertical train all lie in one tall atrium. The changed bridge gives access to the return chute, and the echo carries the original workshop lantern back to the high dock reached empty-handed.",
    "interconnection": "A seed launch reaches the hanging wall. Turning the wall supplies the west tally bridge, the carrier departure, and the later return over the same launch well. After storing the high dock, descend on the same carrier to that bridge and the western return chute. The original workshop lantern is recovered and transferred to that dock as shade for the final route.",
